###
### Card Transactions Analytics - Sveobuhvatni API Test
### Testiranje prema specifikaciji iz dokumenta
###

# =================================
# 1. INFRASTRUKTURA - Health Checks
# =================================

### Eureka Server Health
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json

### Columnar Database Service Health  
GET http://localhost:9050/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Elasticsearch Service Health
GET http://localhost:9080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Gateway Health
GET http://localhost:9003/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

# =================================
# 2. TRANSAKCIONA OBRADA PODATAKA
# =================================

### Kreiranje pojedinačne transakcije
POST http://localhost:9050/api/tx
Content-Type: application/json

