# =================================
# 3. ČITANJE PODATAKA - Različiti upiti
# =================================

### Transakcije korisnika za danas
GET http://localhost:9050/reports/users/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001/transactions/today?limit=100
Accept: application/json

### Transakcije korisnika za određeni dan
GET http://localhost:9050/reports/users/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001/transactions/day?date=2025-09-29&limit=50
Accept: application/json

### Transakcije po kategoriji za dan
GET http://localhost:9050/reports/categories/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174004/transactions/day?date=2025-09-29&limit=50
Accept: application/json

### Transakcije po trgovcu za dan  
GET http://localhost:9050/reports/merchants/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174003/transactions/day?date=2025-09-29&limit=50
Accept: application/json

### Totali korisnika za dan
GET http://localhost:9050/reports/users/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001/totals/day?date=2025-09-29
Accept: application/json

# =================================
# 4. GENERATOR IZVEŠTAJA
# =================================

### Category Report (Analitički izveštaj po kategoriji)
GET http://localhost:9050/reports/analytics/category-report?categoryId=123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174004&fromDate=2025-09-29&toDate=2025-09-29
Accept: application/json

### User Activity Report (Izveštaj aktivnosti korisnika)
GET http://localhost:9050/reports/analytics/user-activity?userId=123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001&fromDate=2025-09-29&toDate=2025-09-29
Accept: application/json

### Complex Daily Report (Kompleksni dnevni izveštaj)
GET http://localhost:9050/reports/analytics/complex-daily?date=2025-09-29
Accept: application/json

# =================================
# 5. INTEGRACIJA SA ELASTICSEARCH
# =================================

### Health check Elasticsearch integracije
GET http://localhost:9050/api/integration/elasticsearch/health
Accept: application/json

### Sinhronizacija podataka sa Elasticsearch
POST http://localhost:9050/api/integration/elasticsearch/sync-categories?categoryId=123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174004&date=2025-09-29
Accept: application/json

### Force sync sa Elasticsearch
POST http://localhost:9050/api/integration/elasticsearch/force-sync
Accept: application/json

### Combined Analytics Report (Kombinovani izveštaj iz oba servisa)
GET http://localhost:9050/api/integration/analytics/combined-report?categoryId=123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174004&fromDate=2025-09-29&toDate=2025-09-29
Accept: application/json

# =================================
# 6. BRISANJE PODATAKA
# =================================

### Brisanje transakcije po ključu korisnika
DELETE http://localhost:9050/api/tx/users/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001/date/2025-09-29/time/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
Accept: application/json

# =================================
# 7. SERVICE DISCOVERY (EUREKA)
# =================================

### Lista registrovanih servisa
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/xml

### Informacije o Columnar servisu
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps/COLUMNAR-DATABASE-SERVICE
Accept: application/json

### Informacije o Elasticsearch servisu  
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps/ELASTICSEARCH-DATABASE-SERVICE
Accept: application/json

# =================================
# 8. GATEWAY RUTIRANJE
# =================================

### Pristup Columnar servisu kroz Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/columnar/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Transakcija kroz Gateway
POST http://localhost:8080/columnar/api/tx
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "txId": "523e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "userId": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001",
