# =================================
# 10. AGREGACIJE I ANALITIKA
# =================================

### Top trgovci za period
GET http://localhost:9050/reports/merchants/top?period=DAY&periodKey=2025-09-29&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Top kategorije za period  
GET http://localhost:9050/reports/categories/top?period=DAY&periodKey=2025-09-29&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Cross-period analiza
GET http://localhost:9050/reports/analytics/cross-period?fromPeriod=2025-09-28&toPeriod=2025-09-29
Accept: application/json